<BaseLayout title="oscar-wallpaper">
  <h1>oscar-wallpaper</h1>
  <p>oscar-wallpaper is a personal tool that runs on a home server. It renders a wallpaper image and puts it on the TVs in one household: it casts the image to the TV over the home network, and it keeps a Google Photos album per TV holding only the current wallpaper, which the TV's screensaver shows.</p>
  <p>It is used only by its owner and is not offered to anyone else.</p>
  <p><a href="privacy.html">Privacy policy</a></p>
</BaseLayout>
